input.body:
Dear Reservas,

Following your reply about August availability, I would like to request a hold — without prepayment — on one garden-side quiet double room for two guests, checking in on 16 August and checking out on 23 August 2026 (7 nights), at the flexible rate you quoted (USD 1,623 total, free cancellation until 18:00 local two days before arrival).

We arrive from Baltra around midday on 16 August. Could you confirm:

- that the room is on the garden side and away from the street;
- the deposit terms, if any;
- the exact cancellation deadline in local time;
- whether breakfast is available and at what price.

Please treat this as a hold request only; I will confirm the booking and provide guest details separately. If a hold is not possible, please tell me how long the flexible rate can be guaranteed.

Best regards,
Lin Qiao

